WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:05.990
Watchmen is one of the most ambitious and
confusing new shows on TV.

00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:11.330
Like, there’s these squids, an elephant,
and pigs, and a catapult throwin clones on

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:16.520
a moon, and there’s Lube Man, a meteor,
mind control, magic eggs, blue dongs, flashbacks

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:22.930
and twists, like what is going on? but there’re
also these serious heavy themes of trauma

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:26.110
and masks and race in America.

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:31.480
And the whole thing’s a sequel of sorts
to the original 1986 Watchmen, a comic book

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:37.469
about superheroes – the new Watchmen is
set thirty years later, and its timeline interconnects

00:00:37.469 --> 00:00:42.590
with the original to reframe the story of
heroes in America.

00:00:42.590 --> 00:00:47.579
So what happens in the new Watchmen, how does
it connect with the comic, and what does it

00:00:47.579 --> 00:00:48.789
all mean?

00:00:48.789 --> 00:00:51.429
Here’s the basic timeline in the comic.

00:00:51.429 --> 00:00:55.730
The first masked hero was Hooded Justice,
in 1938.

00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:59.769
He inspired the Minutemen, a group of heroes
in the 40s.

00:00:59.769 --> 00:01:05.019
In 1960 came Dr. Manhattan, the only hero
with actual superpowers.

00:01:05.019 --> 00:01:09.930
Manhattan won the Vietnam War, and Vietnam
became a state of America – Richard Nixon

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:12.670
stayed president for decades.

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:18.039
In 77, heroes were banned – only Manhattan
and the brutal Comedian could keep working

00:01:18.039 --> 00:01:19.480
for the government.

00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:22.789
In 1985, the main story begins.

00:01:22.789 --> 00:01:27.270
Everyone fears nuclear war with Russia, and
the Comedian is murdered.

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:33.369
A weirdo called Rorschach investigates, along
with Dan aka Nite Owl, and Laurie, aka Silk

00:01:33.369 --> 00:01:34.469
Spectre.

00:01:34.469 --> 00:01:40.750
Adrian Veidt, a rich narcissistic genius,
attacks New York with a giant psychic squid

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:45.789
that looks like an alien, as a hoax to convince
the world to make peace.

00:01:45.789 --> 00:01:48.409
And it works – the Cold War ends.

00:01:48.409 --> 00:01:52.759
Dr. Manhattan kills Rorschach to keep the
hoax a secret.

00:01:52.759 --> 00:01:54.499
Dan and Laurie fall in love.

00:01:54.499 --> 00:02:01.369
Dr. Manhattan leaves Earth, and says “Nothing
ever ends” . That’s the original comic.

00:02:01.369 --> 00:02:06.329
The new show continues the story in 2019,
and adds worldbuilding about the last thirty

00:02:06.329 --> 00:02:10.090
years, partly on a website called Peteypedia.

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:15.390
So in the 90s, Veidt helped real-world actor
Robert Redford become President . Redford

00:02:15.390 --> 00:02:20.660
introduced liberal policies like Redfordations,
which gives tax breaks to victims of racial

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:26.650
violence . In response, right-wing extremists
emerged, like the Seventh Kavalry – a group

00:02:26.650 --> 00:02:30.310
of white supremacists wearing Rorschach’s
mask.

00:02:30.310 --> 00:02:34.550
The Kavalry works with Cyclops, an offshoot
of the Klan.

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:40.100
Senator Keene, and Police Chief Crawford are
secretly Cyclops members, and in 2016, they

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:43.290
orchestrated an attack on police called White
Night.

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:49.030
A new law was a passed so police wear masks,
and Keene uses the conflict between the Kavalry

00:02:49.030 --> 00:02:56.700
and cops to gain political power . In Episode
1, 2019, this guy Will kills Judd, and Angela

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:58.460
Laurie and Wade investigate.

00:02:58.460 --> 00:03:04.310
Meanwhile, it turns out that Dr. Manhattan
is in Tulsa in human form as Cal.

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:09.730
Keene and Cyclops capture him and try to take
his power, then trillionaire Lady Trieu kills

00:03:09.730 --> 00:03:15.010
Cyclops to take Manhattan for herself, but
then she’s killed by squids.

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:21.070
So like in the original comic, the main heroes
of the story are barely involved in ‘saving

00:03:21.070 --> 00:03:22.070
the day’.

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:27.010
The point of Watchmen is exploring the lives
and perspectives of these characters.

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:33.340
So what are the stories of Veidt, Will, Angela,
Laurie, Wade and Manhattan?

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:39.230
Adrian Veidt was born super smart and ambitious
. He idolised Alexander the Great and the

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:46.030
Egyptian pharaohs , so he took the name Ozymandias,
and resolved to do great things . In the 50s,

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:50.780
he fought crime as a hero , but he realised
that punching criminals won’t save the world

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:56.940
– Veidt decided to prevent nuclear war . So
he quit being a superhero, and built a corporate

00:03:56.940 --> 00:04:02.530
empire , becoming rich and famous off electric
cars, like an 80s Elon Musk.

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:05.940
In 85, he attacked New York with a squid to
end war.

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:11.880
Veidt achieves world peace – but he kills
three million people, leaving him feeling

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:16.699
alienated from humanity . The TV show continues
from there.

00:04:16.699 --> 00:04:23.620
Veidt keeps raining squids from the sky, keeping
everyone scared to maintain world peace . Veidt

00:04:23.620 --> 00:04:29.480
influences politics, getting Redford elected
in 92 . Veidt asks Redford to work with him

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:35.880
to build a “utopia” , but Redford doesn’t
listen . Veidt loses his influence and popularity

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:42.540
– he becomes “reclusive” , frustrated,
and irrelevant . In 2008, Lady Trieu turns

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:44.590
up and says she’s his daughter.

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:50.870
Cause turns out, back in 85, one of Veidt’s
staff, called Bian, stole a semen sample from

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:54.110
Veidt, impregnated herself, and gave birth
to Trieu.

00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:59.120
Trieu asks for Veidt’s help and his money
for her plan to save the world by capturing

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:00.120
Dr. Manhattan.

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:06.700
But Veidt is too proud and stubborn, and rejects
his daughter . The next year, Dr. Manhattan

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:10.050
visits, and Veidt gives him a memory-blocking
device.

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:13.690
In return, Manhattan does a favour for Veidt.

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:19.180
Manhattan describes the world he’s created
on Europa, a “paradise” inhabited by the

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:22.500
kind and adoring Philips and Crookshanks.

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:27.650
Veidt feels so hopeless and defeated that
he asks Manhattan to teleport him there . So

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:33.990
Veidt lives on Europa for eight years, and
it sucks . Cause the Philips and Crookshanks

00:05:33.990 --> 00:05:40.000
have no purpose , no doubt , no identity , no
sex , they’re boring – it’s like living

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:46.250
in The Sims, or in the Garden of Eden before
sin . So Veidt makes a plan to escape Europa

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:51.650
. Back in 08, Lady Trieu mentioned a probe
she was sending to photograph Europa, which

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:58.080
would arrive in 2013 . So Veidt spends four
years creating a message for the probe to

00:05:58.080 --> 00:05:59.080
see.

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:03.840
He catapults Phillipses and Crookshankses
out of the bubble of life and onto the surface

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:10.440
of Europa to die, so he can use their corpses
to spell out the words “SAVE ME DAUGHTER”,

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:13.180
so that Trieu would see and save him.

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:18.250
The way Veidt uses the corpses of his servants
is a lot like the Black Freighter story from

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:19.710
the original comic.

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:24.870
In that story, a sailor is stuck on an island,
so he uses his friends’ corpses to build

00:06:24.870 --> 00:06:27.070
a raft and sail home.

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:31.870
The comic compares Veidt’s feelings with
the sailor’s guilt and alienation.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:37.830
Over the years, Veidt clashes with the Game
Warden, who tries to stop Veidt escaping.

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:42.960
But in the end, Veidt reveals that he wanted
the Warden to try to stop him . Veidt finally

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:48.110
kills the Warden with a horseshoe that Philips
tried to give him years ago . It seems like

00:06:48.110 --> 00:06:53.410
this whole conflict was scripted – like
the play that Veidt writes, and like that

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:57.110
absurd trial where Crookshanks winks.

00:06:57.110 --> 00:07:02.020
Was Veidt really struggling to escape, or
was this all theatre to keep himself busy

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:03.410
til he could leave?

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:09.780
Veidt needs drama and adversity to thrive
– and he doesn’t care if innocents die

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:14.850
for his pride . Trieu sees the message, and
sends a spaceship to rescue Veidt.

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:20.610
She freezes him in golden carbonite for the
journey – so Veidt looks like yellow yolk

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:26.530
within an egg-shaped ship – one of many
references to eggs this season.

00:07:26.530 --> 00:07:32.800
Veidt arrives on Earth in about 2017 – this
meteor thing in a flashback is Veidt’s spaceship

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:33.800
landing.

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:38.900
But Trieu doesn’t unfreeze Veidt right away
– she’s still angry that her dad rejected

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:39.900
her.

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:44.970
So she keeps Veidt as a statue in her garden
for years – looking like one his action

00:07:44.970 --> 00:07:48.139
figures, a monument to his vanity.

00:07:48.139 --> 00:07:54.180
Trieu only thaws Veidt out in the season finale,
cause she wants him to see her plan succeed,

00:07:54.180 --> 00:08:00.080
to prove she can win without him . But just
as Trieu is about to steal Manhattan’s godlike

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:05.650
powers, Veidt is teleported to his base, and
he sends a frozen squid shower to destroy

00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:13.410
Trieu and half of Tulsa . So once again, Veidt
does something terrible to supposedly save

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:19.000
the world – he kills his own daughter, who
had rescued him from space, to prevent her

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:24.170
from getting Manhattan’s power . But this
time, he doesn’t get away with it.

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:29.580
Wade and Laurie arrest Veidt, so he’ll finally
be brought to justice for his squid attacks,

00:08:29.580 --> 00:08:35.839
which sucks for him, but on the upside, he
might finally get that recognition and attention

00:08:35.839 --> 00:08:37.779
he so wanted.

00:08:37.779 --> 00:08:43.889
Ozymandias’ story is a warning that too
much vanity, ambition and pride can separate

00:08:43.889 --> 00:08:49.220
you from humanity – as though marooned on
a distant moon.

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:55.149
Will’s story stretches a hundred years,
from the genesis of superheroes to the present.

00:08:55.149 --> 00:09:01.810
Episode 1 starts in Tulsa, Oklahoma 1921,
with the Tulsa race riot.

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:06.670
This was a real historical event where a mob
of white people attacked a wealthy black community

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:11.230
– killing many people, and destroying the
neighbourhood.

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:17.339
Young Will loses his home and family, but
he escapes like baby Superman outta Krypton

00:09:17.339 --> 00:09:22.459
. Later, Will comes to New York and becomes
a cop – but the police are corrupt, and

00:09:22.459 --> 00:09:25.660
Will’s brutally attacked.

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:31.250
So Will becomes Hooded Justice, the first
hero in Watchmen – he saves a couple from

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:33.839
being mugged, just like in the comic.

00:09:33.839 --> 00:09:39.370
But Will uses white makeup to hide his race,
fearing that white America wouldn’t accept

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:45.619
a black vigilante . So turns out, the first
superhero doesn’t wear a costume to look

00:09:45.619 --> 00:09:51.360
cool – like he wears a mask to survive in
an unjust society, and the noose on his neck

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:53.809
is from his near-lynching.

00:09:53.809 --> 00:09:58.689
He inspires the whole tradition of heroes
in Watchmen, but America thinks he’s a white

00:09:58.689 --> 00:10:04.240
man, and never understands the real story
of Hooded Justice . Peteypedia compares this

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:09.459
to the iconic Western movie hero The Lone
Ranger – who, some speculate, may’ve been

00:10:09.459 --> 00:10:15.319
inspired by the real-world black lawman Bass
Reeves . It’s an invitation to rethink the

00:10:15.319 --> 00:10:21.939
biases in the stories America tells about
power violence and race . As in the comic,

00:10:21.939 --> 00:10:27.820
Will has a relationship with Nelson Gardner,
aka Captain Metropolis, and joins his group,

00:10:27.820 --> 00:10:32.949
the Minutemen – in the background here,
you can see Silhouette, Mothman, the Comedian

00:10:32.949 --> 00:10:35.069
and the first Nite Owl.

00:10:35.069 --> 00:10:40.809
Will uncovers a conspiracy by the Klan group
Cyclops to use mind control against black

00:10:40.809 --> 00:10:46.269
people . Will asks Metropolis for help, but
he doesn’t wanna get involved – the Minutemen

00:10:46.269 --> 00:10:52.550
just want publicity, some of which perpetuates
racism . Will is fighting to protect a society

00:10:52.550 --> 00:10:59.170
that doesn’t protect him, so Will is angry
and frustrated, his wife and son leave him.

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:04.660
Will’s son eventually has a daughter named
Angela – so Will is Angela’s grandfather

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:12.059
. In 55, Will breaks up with Metropolis, quits
the police, and disappears . In 74, Metropolis

00:11:12.059 --> 00:11:17.490
dies , and leaves all his money and his mansion
to Will . Metropolis says he was “wrong”

00:11:17.490 --> 00:11:24.600
to not help Will, and says of all the Minutemen,
only Will was “fighting true evil” . In

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:28.040
2009, Dr. Manhattan visits.

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:33.319
Manhattan fell in love with Will’s granddaughter
Angela, and he knows that shit will go down,

00:11:33.319 --> 00:11:38.999
so Manhattan suggests an “alliance” between
Will and Lady Trieu to take down Cyclops . So

00:11:38.999 --> 00:11:44.829
in Episode 1, Will kills Cyclops member Judd
Crawford – using the same mind control tech

00:11:44.829 --> 00:11:47.500
that Cyclops used back in New York.

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:52.779
Lady Trieu helps Will by grabbing him in a
car to so Angela can’t arrest him.

00:11:52.779 --> 00:11:58.739
And in the finale, Trieu kills the leaders
of Cyclops, after reading a letter by Will

00:11:58.739 --> 00:12:00.510
about their crimes.

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:06.529
So a hundred years after the Tulsa massacre,
and New York, Hooded Justice finally gets

00:12:06.529 --> 00:12:12.100
“justice” . After a century of trauma
, Will can start to heal his wounds , and

00:12:12.100 --> 00:12:15.940
to look to the future – he has a family
now, with Angela.

00:12:15.940 --> 00:12:22.399
Will’s story is about the long legacy of
injustice, masks and pain in America, and

00:12:22.399 --> 00:12:26.490
looks to the potential for justice and healing.

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:31.930
Angela was born in Vietnam in the 70s – lots
of African Americans moved there after Vietnam

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:33.300
became a state.

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:37.470
In 87, Angela’s parents were killed in an
attack.

00:12:37.470 --> 00:12:42.470
She identified the culprit for the cops, and
got her first taste of justice from police

00:12:42.470 --> 00:12:43.470
work.

00:12:43.470 --> 00:12:49.660
She also idolised Sister Night, a badass movie
superhero . So Angela grew up an orphan and

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:56.529
became a cop in Vietnam . In 2009, she’s
alone, and empty, and grieving.

00:12:56.529 --> 00:13:00.170
Then this blue MF turns up and says he’s
in love with her.

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:04.999
Dr. Manhattan experiences the future and past
all at once, so he’s in love with Angela

00:13:04.999 --> 00:13:07.069
before he even meets her.

00:13:07.069 --> 00:13:13.380
Manhattan says their love will end in tragedy,
but all love ends in tragedy, so they start

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:14.889
a relationship.

00:13:14.889 --> 00:13:19.889
To hide the fact that Manhattan is a blue
all-powerful god, he takes the identity and

00:13:19.889 --> 00:13:22.829
appearance of a dead guy called Cal.

00:13:22.829 --> 00:13:28.309
After the random tragic death of her parents,
Angela finds it reassuring that Manhattan

00:13:28.309 --> 00:13:29.309
knows the future.

00:13:29.309 --> 00:13:34.699
But it can also be really annoying to have
a boyfriend who knows everything and fears

00:13:34.699 --> 00:13:40.019
nothing – Manhattan’s previous girlfriends
complained of the same . So Manhattan decides

00:13:40.019 --> 00:13:45.040
to become more like a normal human for Angela
. He gets Veidt to give him a device that

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:49.709
blocks his memory – Manhattan stops using
his powers because he doesn’t remember he

00:13:49.709 --> 00:13:55.279
has them , he temporarily sacrifices his godhood
for Angela.

00:13:55.279 --> 00:13:59.889
They get married, move to Tulsa, Angela joins
the police, and they start a life together

00:13:59.889 --> 00:14:03.889
. But in 2016, the Seventh Kavalry attack
on White Night.

00:14:03.889 --> 00:14:09.149
A gunman almost kills Angela, but a failsafe
in Manhattan’s memory block kicks in , and

00:14:09.149 --> 00:14:14.189
he saves Angela by teleporting her attacker
away – that’s how Joe Keene finds out

00:14:14.189 --> 00:14:20.040
that Manhattan is in Tulsa, and starts planning
to capture him . Dozens of police are killed

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:25.610
on White Night, including Angela’s police
partner Doyle . So Angela and Cal adopt Doyle’s

00:14:25.610 --> 00:14:28.660
children – Topher, Rosie and Emma.

00:14:28.660 --> 00:14:33.449
After White Night, Angela pretends to quit
the police and start a bakery . But secretly,

00:14:33.449 --> 00:14:36.309
she takes the identity of Sister Night.

00:14:36.309 --> 00:14:42.629
She hides her pain behind a mask , and fights
for justice . Judd and Jane Crawford make

00:14:42.629 --> 00:14:47.600
friends with Angela and Cal, but only because
the Crawfords and Keene are planning to betray

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:53.450
and capture Manhattan – so the Crawfords
are incredibly cold and manipulative.

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:59.190
In 2019, Angela meets Will, and experiences
his memories , and learns that she’s part

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:05.110
of his legacy of survivors and fighters and
masks . Angela learns of the plot to capture

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:09.540
Manhattan, so she removes his memory device,
and fights to protect him.

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:14.399
Manhattan tells her that she can’t save
him, but she fights for him anyway, and Manhattan

00:15:14.399 --> 00:15:20.670
says that’s why he loves her – her determination
and love in the face of the pain and adversity

00:15:20.670 --> 00:15:27.350
she’s faced . In the end, Angela loses Manhattan,
just as she lost her parents.

00:15:27.350 --> 00:15:32.120
But before he died, Manhattan said he could
put his powers in an egg, so that someone

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:38.220
else could get his powers . Angela eats Manhattan’s
egg, and tests to see if she can walk on water

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:40.920
– and the season ends.

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:44.779
So does Angela get Manhattan’s godlike powers?

00:15:44.779 --> 00:15:46.119
Should she?

00:15:46.119 --> 00:15:51.899
The season explores how power can be misused
– by Veidt, Keene, Trieu and by Manhattan

00:15:51.899 --> 00:15:52.899
himself.

00:15:52.899 --> 00:15:58.499
But maybe, after her experiences, Angela has
the right perspective to do some good.

00:15:58.499 --> 00:16:04.170
Angela Abar was named after an old movie called
“Abar, the First Black Superman” – maybe

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:07.519
Angela Abar is the hero the world needs.

00:16:07.519 --> 00:16:13.209
Or maybe Angela doesn’t want to be a hero
any more.

00:16:13.209 --> 00:16:17.189
The ending’s ambiguous – it’s entirely
in your hands.

00:16:17.189 --> 00:16:21.269
Dr. Manhattan was once an ordinary boy called
Jon.

00:16:21.269 --> 00:16:26.139
In the 30s, he and his father fled Germany
for an English manor . Jon saw the Lord and

00:16:26.139 --> 00:16:30.379
Lady of the manor having sex, and Jon stole
an apple.

00:16:30.379 --> 00:16:34.749
This represents the Bible story of the forbidden
fruit with Adam and Eve.

00:16:34.749 --> 00:16:40.230
The Lord and Lady give Jon a Bible, and describe
the story of Genesis, with God making the

00:16:40.230 --> 00:16:47.540
world – they ask Jon to “create something
beautiful” . So fifty years later, Jon creates

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:52.759
life on Europa in the image of the Lord and
Lady and their manor – cause while Manhattan

00:16:52.759 --> 00:16:56.509
is godlike, he’s not very original.

00:16:56.509 --> 00:17:01.489
In the original Watchmen, Jon and his father
moved to New York, where his father was a

00:17:01.489 --> 00:17:02.699
watchmaker.

00:17:02.699 --> 00:17:09.839
Jon became a scientist, and in 1959 suffered
an accident that ripped his atoms apart.

00:17:09.839 --> 00:17:15.380
But like a watchmaker, he reassembled himself
and returned as Dr. Manhattan.

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:19.919
In the TV show, Veidt writes a play called
The Watchmaker’s Son , which retells this

00:17:19.919 --> 00:17:22.490
story of Manhattan’s genesis.

00:17:22.490 --> 00:17:27.589
Manhattan won the Vietnam War for America
– which leads to Vietnamese nationalist

00:17:27.589 --> 00:17:33.000
terrorism, including the attack that kills
Angela’s parents – so indirectly, Manhattan

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:39.450
causes Angela to be orphaned . Manhattan has
a relationship with Laurie, aka Silk Spectre

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:41.620
aka Agent Blake.

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:46.620
In 85, Manhattan goes to Mars , cause he’s
sick of humans and their BS.

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:51.359
But Laurie convinces Manhattan that human
life is special because of its improbability

00:17:51.359 --> 00:17:56.809
– the “thermo-dynamic miracle” . At
the end of the comic, Manhattan leaves Earth

00:17:56.809 --> 00:17:58.960
, to create life elsewhere.

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:04.490
So then in the show, Manhattan creates life
on Europa . He creates Philips and Crookshanks

00:18:04.490 --> 00:18:08.990
to be better than the humans of Earth – to
be “Kind” and “gentle” beings in a

00:18:08.990 --> 00:18:14.360
new “Garden of Eden” . But paradise gets
boring, and after twenty years, Manhattan

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:20.520
returns to Earth to meet his love Angela . Manhattan
visits Will and starts the alliance with Lady

00:18:20.520 --> 00:18:22.620
Trieu to stop Cyclops.

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:27.100
Manhattan does this knowing it’ll lead to
his death , but Manhattan has experienced

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:32.530
the future, and he knows it’s inevitable
. Manhattan becomes Cal, blocks his memory,

00:18:32.530 --> 00:18:37.260
and spends ten years with Angela , until Angela
makes him Manhattan again.

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:43.389
In the finale, Trieu destroys Manhattan, and
as he dies, Manhattan experiences every moment

00:18:43.389 --> 00:18:49.710
he was with Angela all at once, and he dies
telling her he loves her . So the original

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:56.100
comic explored how superhuman powers can be
dehumanising – a god wouldn’t care about

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:57.230
people.

00:18:57.230 --> 00:19:02.200
But Watchmen 2019 takes a different perspective
– exploring how Manhattan’s powers make

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:06.850
him more human, an infinite God of infinite
love.

00:19:06.850 --> 00:19:12.440
He experiences past present and future all
at once, so he is forever an innocent child,

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:17.960
a dying scientist , a God, a husband and lover
all at once.

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:23.929
From his perspective outside time, not even
death can end his love – cause “Nothing

00:19:23.929 --> 00:19:25.480
ever ends”.

00:19:25.480 --> 00:19:31.150
The Bible stuff comes full circle as well,
cause Manhattan knowingly goes to his death,

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:36.510
sacrificing himself like Christ – only for
his power to be resurrected in Angela, walking

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:38.550
on water like Jesus.

00:19:38.550 --> 00:19:44.760
So Manhattan was kind of useless in the original
comic – like Will says, “he could've done

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:45.760
more”.

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:50.419
Perhaps this sacrifice is the redemption of
a God.

00:19:50.419 --> 00:19:54.250
If nothing else, dude hangs dong.

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:58.630
Laurie is the daughter of Sally Jupiter aka
Silk Spectre.

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:03.951
Sally raised Laurie to be the second Silk
Spectre, a glamourous sexy superhero “Just

00:20:03.951 --> 00:20:09.330
like her mom” . Laurie hooked up with Dr.
Manhattan, and retired from being a hero . But

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:15.200
Manhattan’s a bad boyfriend, so Laurie leaves
him, and hooks up with Dan aka Nite Owl.

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:20.519
Laurie and Dan fail to stop Ozymandias’
plan, but they bond over rediscovering being

00:20:20.519 --> 00:20:22.549
heroes together.

00:20:22.549 --> 00:20:27.649
On Mars, Laurie finds out that her father
is the Comedian, the nihilistic brute who

00:20:27.649 --> 00:20:33.500
once assaulted her mother – so Laurie is
devastated, and feels that her life is a cruel

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:37.730
meaningless “joke” . At the end of the
comic, Laurie goes off into the sunset with

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:43.309
Dan, planning to be heroes, but Laurie’s
attitude has changed – she wants a different

00:20:43.309 --> 00:20:48.490
costume, with a mask and a gun – just like
the Comedian’s costume.

00:20:48.490 --> 00:20:54.380
So in the new Watchmen, according to Peteypedia,
Laurie started calling herself “The Comedienne”

00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:59.139
after her father . Laurie and Dan worked as
heroes for a while, but they broke up, because

00:20:59.139 --> 00:21:04.160
Dan “wanted kids”, while Laurie “wanted
guns” . And Dan felt that Laurie was still

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:10.379
in love with Dr. Manhattan, so he made her
a giant blue dildo as a ‘literal F you’

00:21:10.379 --> 00:21:16.500
. The dildo, by the way, is named Excalibur
. In the nineties, Laurie and Dan got arrested,

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:21.280
because heroes are still illegal . Dan refused
to cooperate with the cops, so he’s still

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:26.580
in jail – Laurie keeps an owl in a cage
as an ironic tribute to Nite Owl.

00:21:26.580 --> 00:21:31.840
But Laurie made a deal with the cops to let
her free so long she works for the FBI’s

00:21:31.840 --> 00:21:38.700
Anti-Vigilante Squad – so Laurie goes from
a hero to a hero hunter – we see her ruthlessly

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:45.140
gun a man down , and she takes her father’s
name, Blake – she embraced The Comedian’s

00:21:45.140 --> 00:21:46.440
dark legacy.

00:21:46.440 --> 00:21:52.460
Cause Laurie is hurt by her origins, and by
the feeling that Dr. Manhattan abandoned her

00:21:52.460 --> 00:21:57.130
. So she hides the “trauma” behind a mask
of cynicism.

00:21:57.130 --> 00:22:01.450
Like the Comedian, she calls everything a
“joke” , and laughs at the injustice and

00:22:01.450 --> 00:22:03.330
absurdity of the world.

00:22:03.330 --> 00:22:07.620
When she gets captured by Cyclops, she says
she doesn’t care about their evil plan,

00:22:07.620 --> 00:22:13.100
that she’s tired of all the “silliness”
. But in the end, Laurie does care.

00:22:13.100 --> 00:22:18.460
Cause Cyclops’ plan is to kill Laurie’s
ex, Dr. Manhattan, and when Laurie sees him,

00:22:18.460 --> 00:22:24.690
she shows some real emotion for once . She
still loves Manhattan, or at least, is nostalgic

00:22:24.690 --> 00:22:27.009
for a time when she felt love.

00:22:27.009 --> 00:22:32.779
And later, Laurie sees Dan’s old airship
Archie, and she shows genuine awe and joy

00:22:32.779 --> 00:22:37.769
again . It’s like Laurie’s ex-boyfriends
remind her of what it’s like to let down

00:22:37.769 --> 00:22:40.880
the mask and feel something real.

00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:44.240
So in the end, Laurie and Wade arrest Veidt.

00:22:44.240 --> 00:22:49.289
For thirty years, Laurie kept the secret that
Veidt was behind the squid attack, but now

00:22:49.289 --> 00:22:53.059
she changes her mind and decides to bring
some actual justice.

00:22:53.059 --> 00:22:55.289
“People change” , she says.

00:22:55.289 --> 00:23:00.700
“I'm not joking” , she says, cause now,
she’s not being the cynical Comedienne,

00:23:00.700 --> 00:23:05.890
she’s doing something she actually believes
in to make the world better.

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:11.360
So it’s subtle, but Laurie’s story takes
her away from the cynicism of her father,

00:23:11.360 --> 00:23:15.399
and towards some sincerity and hope.

00:23:15.399 --> 00:23:17.679
Wade is a new character in Watchmen.

00:23:17.679 --> 00:23:23.150
His story begins in 1985, the night of Veidt’s
squid attack.

00:23:23.150 --> 00:23:28.169
Wade is a Jehovah’s Witness, evangelising
at a carnival, under the shadow of imminent

00:23:28.169 --> 00:23:33.500
nuclear war . He meets some knot-tops – who
are like a punk subculture from the comic.

00:23:33.500 --> 00:23:38.490
And a knot-top seduces him – which is a
challenge to Wade’s religious faith.

00:23:38.490 --> 00:23:43.830
This temptation is a formative moment for
young Wade – like Jon taking the apple,

00:23:43.830 --> 00:23:50.669
like biblical original sin, Wade tries grow
beyond innocence, but the girl betrays him.

00:23:50.669 --> 00:23:55.269
As if that wasn’t enough humiliation, then
the world ends.

00:23:55.269 --> 00:24:01.629
The squid hits New York, sending a psychic
shockwave that kills millions of people.

00:24:01.629 --> 00:24:07.889
So this religious kid tries one time to get
his Watchtower wet, and the result is unimaginable

00:24:07.889 --> 00:24:14.649
horror – Wade is scarred, and grows up to
be a damaged lonely person . His relationship

00:24:14.649 --> 00:24:19.200
with an ex fails because he can’t trust
anyone , cause when he was vulnerable before,

00:24:19.200 --> 00:24:21.220
he was shamed and traumatised.

00:24:21.220 --> 00:24:27.059
He’s paranoid, hyper-vigilant for more squid
attacks, so he lives in a bunker and wears

00:24:27.059 --> 00:24:32.180
a tinfoil hat . Wade runs a support group
for survivors, and says that he’s “no

00:24:32.180 --> 00:24:38.650
longer afraid”, but that’s a lie – Wade
wears a mask to hide his pain.

00:24:38.650 --> 00:24:44.259
After White Night, Wade became the hero Looking
Glass, an expert at interrogation, and detecting

00:24:44.259 --> 00:24:49.700
deception , which are the exact skills that
could’ve helped him with the girl in 85.

00:24:49.700 --> 00:24:54.259
In 2019, Wade goes out with a woman from his
support group – but she turns out to be

00:24:54.259 --> 00:25:00.350
a Klansman who tricks Wade into capture . So
once again, when Wade is emotionally vulnerable

00:25:00.350 --> 00:25:06.259
with someone, it just gets him another “kick
in the balls” . Wade finds out that the

00:25:06.259 --> 00:25:12.639
85 squid attack, the catastrophe that broke
Wade, was a hoax by Adrian Veidt.

00:25:12.639 --> 00:25:18.659
So Wade questions his whole life – “Is
anything true?” he asks . In the finale,

00:25:18.659 --> 00:25:24.659
Wade goes deep into enemy territory, and faces
the man who caused his trauma , and Wade arrests

00:25:24.659 --> 00:25:26.740
him, with a spanner.

00:25:26.740 --> 00:25:34.580
Wade finally gets justice, and he takes off
his mask – the first steps towards healing.

00:25:34.580 --> 00:25:38.460
So in some ways, Watchmen 2019 is cynical.

00:25:38.460 --> 00:25:41.909
It’s about violence and trauma.

00:25:41.909 --> 00:25:45.799
The utopian dreams of Adrian Veidt and Lady
Trieu fail.

00:25:45.799 --> 00:25:49.440
Dr. Manhattan, the god figure, dies.

00:25:49.440 --> 00:25:52.330
But the story also has hope.

00:25:52.330 --> 00:25:57.390
Will achieves justice and healing after centuries
of injustice and pain.

00:25:57.390 --> 00:26:00.860
Angela gets godlike power.

00:26:00.860 --> 00:26:04.120
Manhattan becomes a figure of transcendent
love.

00:26:04.120 --> 00:26:07.830
Laurie achieves some optimism, and Wade gets
justice.

00:26:07.830 --> 00:26:13.720
We also got an entire season of Jeremy Irons
eating cake and playing with catapults.

00:26:13.720 --> 00:26:20.190
So Watchmen 2019 isn’t about superheroes
conquering evil, but it is about some people

00:26:20.190 --> 00:26:24.279
who find hope and healing despite the darkness.

00:26:24.279 --> 00:26:29.669
The main symbol of the original Watchmen comic
is a bloody smiley, it appears all throughout

00:26:29.669 --> 00:26:30.669
the comic.

00:26:30.669 --> 00:26:36.539
Cause the bloody smiley represents how the
idea of a hero is broken, outdated, degraded.

00:26:36.539 --> 00:26:42.629
But Watchmen 2019 uses the symbol of the egg
– eggs appear all throughout the show, the

00:26:42.629 --> 00:26:44.350
season ends with an egg.

00:26:44.350 --> 00:26:49.460
Cause the egg is the opposite of the cynical
bloody smiley.

00:26:49.460 --> 00:26:53.580
Eggs represent rebirth, possibility, and life.

00:26:53.580 --> 00:26:59.220
Thirty years after the original comic, this
new show brings hope to Watchmen.

00:26:59.220 --> 00:27:01.500
Thanks for watching.

00:27:01.500 --> 00:27:04.309
If you enjoyed this video please like and
subscribe.

00:27:04.309 --> 00:27:08.799
They take a lot of work to make, so you’re
welcome to support on Patreon for updates,

00:27:08.799 --> 00:27:10.770
livestreams, votes and more.

00:27:10.770 --> 00:27:17.080
Thanks to Patrons Rodney Gitzel, HASAN GOPALANI,
Mike Curry, James Butterworth, Veronica VanCleave-Seeley,

00:27:17.080 --> 00:27:18.250
